== Changelog ==

To help implementers understand updates to this document, a version number resembling ''semantic versioning'' (<tt>MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH</tt>) is used, as described in [[bip-0003.md|BIP 3]]. The <tt>MAJOR</tt> version is incremented for changes incompatible with prior versions, <tt>MINOR</tt> for backward-compatible additions or extensions, and <tt>PATCH</tt> for other noteworthy changes (bug fixes, test vectors, clarifications, etc.).

* '''2.0.0''' (2026-08-11):
** Add the Version 2 derivation scheme with a dedicated <tt>purpose'</tt> field (<tt>m/46'</tt>), <tt>change</tt> set to the conventional external-chain value <tt>0</tt> (<tt>m/46'/0'/0'/0/index</tt>), and a Miniscript-compatible <tt>witness script</tt>, alongside the existing Version 1 scheme (<tt>m/84'/0'/0'/2/index</tt>); add corresponding test vectors and update Rationale and Backwards Compatibility accordingly. Require Version 2 certificate messages to encode <tt>cert_pubkey</tt> as lowercase hex instead of raw bytes, for pure-ASCII hardware wallet compatibility; spell out the exact message-signing preimage, hashing, and signature encoding; add a caveat that generic Miniscript support does not by itself cover every Version 2 bond due to per-bond timelocks; add a worked PSBT v0 example (mature-spend and pre-locktime-failure); note and defer an open question about binding certificates to a specific bond script and network. Feedback from m0wer.
* '''1.0.0''' (2024-05-23):
** Initial version, merged as BIP-46, defining the Version 1 scheme.
